    "slug": "blip",
    "title": "Peer Knowledge for Early-Career Hiring",
    "context": "[[Built and ran Blip]] across design, product and distribution, reaching 15,000 readers across 10+ institutes.",
    "source": "https://www.figma.com/design/urzHdbOj23BjFRMJ28XMhZ/Blip?node-id=0-1",
    "description": "Blip gave students and recent graduates who had secured internships or early-career roles a structured page for sharing how they prepared, what they studied, and which organizations they interviewed with. Others could search those pages by role or organization instead of cold-messaging for advice. Our three-person team built and distributed Blip independently; I shaped the contribution flow and worked with career-services teams across 10+ institutes, reaching roughly 3,000 contributor profiles and 15,000 readers.",
    "galleryDescription": "Early Figma explorations for Blip: the contribution flow, published experience pages, and the search and aggregation views that connected them. We wound Blip down in 2022 when the three-person team moved to separate initiatives, then returned the collected material to the career-services teams that had helped gather it.",
